# NEGATIVE TEST – must make the ontology INCONSISTENT.
# ffonto:wears has domain ffonto:Agent, so a building that "wears" a helmet is
# inferred to be an Agent – which is disjoint with BuiltAsset.
@prefix ffonto: <http://purl.org/ffonto#> .
@prefix ffontov: <http://purl.org/ffonto/vocab#> .
<http://purl.org/ffonto/data/test/b1> a ffonto:BuiltAsset ; ffonto:wears ffontov:Helmet .
